@startuml
!include ../../_common/style.puml
title L3：发送准备阶段异常分支（二期结构版）

actor Caller
participant MessageTemplate
participant EnvelopeEnricher
participant DestinationResolver
participant ProviderRegistry
participant MessageWireCodec
participant MessageSendExecutor

Caller -> MessageTemplate: send(...)

alt 参数非法
  MessageTemplate --> Caller: REJECTED / VALIDATION_ERROR / VALIDATE
else 丰富失败
  MessageTemplate -> EnvelopeEnricher: enrich
  EnvelopeEnricher --> MessageTemplate: exception
  MessageTemplate --> Caller: REJECTED / VALIDATION_ERROR / ENRICH
else 路由缺失或歧义
  MessageTemplate -> DestinationResolver: resolve
  DestinationResolver --> MessageTemplate: exception
  MessageTemplate --> Caller: REJECTED / ROUTING_ERROR / RESOLVE
else Provider 未注册
  MessageTemplate -> ProviderRegistry: getRequired
  ProviderRegistry --> MessageTemplate: exception
  MessageTemplate --> Caller: REJECTED / PROVIDER_NOT_FOUND / RESOLVE
else 不支持基础发布
  MessageTemplate --> Caller: REJECTED / UNSUPPORTED_CAPABILITY / RESOLVE
else 序列化失败
  MessageTemplate -> MessageWireCodec: encode
  MessageWireCodec --> MessageTemplate: exception
  MessageTemplate --> Caller: FAILED / SERIALIZATION_ERROR / SERIALIZE
else 准备成功
  MessageTemplate -> MessageSendExecutor: send(PreparedMessageSend)
end

note over MessageTemplate
准备阶段失败不会进入 MessageSendExecutor，
也不会触发 retry-component。
因为参数、路由、序列化这类错误重试没有意义。
end note
@enduml
